>  <NOTE>  (1) 
Cyclic beta-D-fructofuranose representative. Replaces open-chain fructose for comparison with ring sugars. Derived by cleavage of local sucrose model; RDKit ETKDGv3/MMFF conformer. Fructose also exists in other cyclic and open-chain forms.

